From eb4f8412b1642c75a853332d42ca7069534acff8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 16:33:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] v2.5.4-v2.5.7: QoS priority fix, honest QoS page, ipset
 Policy Routing + GUI, audit-remainder batch

Folds four locally-built, metal-validated rungs into one cut:
- v2.5.4: QoS strict-priority fix (qos.c: delqcfg-all-then-recreate priority=6-qid),
  WRR UI removal (Reaper_QoS.asp), speed-test level_err_cnt fix (internet_speed.html),
  wireless auto-scan no-auto-pin (web.c), Warden rw_threat maxelem 524288 (rwarden.c),
  SDN Wi-Fi-key SSID escape (state.js), overlay re-anchor + loader theming (reaper_shell.asp),
  Firewall/About/Warden translations across the 24 non-EN packs (*.dict).
- v2.5.5: ipset Policy Routing "VPN Director PBR" core (reaper_pbr.c + rc/Makefile, rc.h,
  services.c, firewall.c, defaults.c) + PPPoE post-boot stale-session bounce (rwatch.c).
- v2.5.6: Policy Routing editor page (Reaper_VPNRouting.asp) + menuTree + reaper_inject +
  34 RVR_ dict keys (English-seeded, lockstep).
- v2.5.7: audit-remainder security batch (web.c OOB-read bounds guards, gk_baseline fail-safe,
  usbkey CRLF strip, ejusb guard; httpApi.js chpass POST).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
